+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Two renders with different keys render twice (test/app.render.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Two renders with the same key render once (test/app.render.js) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 The existing caching tests run on a shared helper (test/app.render.js) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Cache views under renderOptions.cacheKey, defaulting to the name (lib/application.js)
